# Clean Git Commits

When creating commits for this project:

- Never add `Co-authored-by` trailers (including Cursor, Copilot, or any AI agent).
- Never add `Made-with`, `Signed-off-by`, or similar attribution lines for AI tools.
- Never mention Cursor, agents, or AI assistance in commit messages.
- Write commit messages as if authored solely by the project owner.
- Only create commits when the user explicitly asks.
